hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1537","Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Durqi and Ahmad bin Mansour Al-Ramadi told us: Hajjaj, who is the son of Muhammad, told us: Ibn Juraij said: Ziyad, who is Ibn Saad, told me that Qaza’a, a client of Abd al-Qais, told him that he heard Ikrimah, a client of Ibn Abbas, saying: Ibn Abbas said: “I prayed next to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and Aisha was behind us, praying with us, and I was next to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace.” And peace be upon him, I will pray with him.”"
